          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.7.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 7:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo t'aneno ruwaŋan oyido nitie pondeponde matar, aka wi pondeponde no onwaŋo nitie nyatoro m'obedo piny m'ocalo gi Wod Dhano, gi sangaria ma zahabu i wiye kodi pala nyangoda mabith i cinge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOL.3.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yowel 3:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo malaika man owok i Ot pa Were to koko gi dwonde ma malo ri ŋat'oyido obedo wi pondeponde ni, “Or nyangoda perin ikeci, kwoŋbedo ndir mere otieko tundo, piny ociek akeca!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo ŋat'obedo wi pondeponde no owito nyangoda pere wi piny to keco gima ni piny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
