              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo malaika no owito nyangoda pere wi piny, otoŋo vini m'onyak, to bolo i bur madwoŋ ma biyo vini ma keme pa Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
